 
***************************************
* Registration form for Yankee Trader *
***************************************

        Yankee Trader represents MANY long hours of work. If you use it for
over 30 days you MUST send in the registration fee. Unlike many doors these
days, there is absolutely no crippling of any sort in Yankee Trader. Then "Why
register?" you may ask? Simple. It gives me an incentive to continue work on
the door. As long as I continue to recieve registrations, I will continue to
keep working on Yankee Trader.

        The reason there ARE so many doors that are crippled until registered
is because so FEW sysops register their doors! Door authors spend a tremendous
amount of time writing these doors and become mighty frustrated when no one
sends them anything for their hard work. It takes a great deal of skill to
write a decent door program. You and your users all benefit from the work of
these skillful authors. Good doors make your system more interesting and
attract and retain callers. For these reasons, you should register ALL the
doors that are worthwhile and help your system grow. (Not just mine!)

        Once you register, you will be netmailed (if you are in the Fidonet
Nodelist) or mailed a letter with your registration number. See YTSYSOP.DOC
for more info.

        The registration fee for "Yankee Trader" is only $20.00. U.S. Funds
only please! REPLACEMENT FOR LOST KEYS: One SASE. (I've been going broke
sending out replacement keys. MAKE BACKUP COPIES!)


